  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Association of Young Water and Sanitation Professionals of Mali, AJPEA Mali is a young apolitical, non-profit organization created in 2013 under the umbrella of African Water Association (AAE). In partnership with Aqua for All, the objective is to strengthen the organisation and create a strong network that organises activities that improve the skills and capabilities of young professionals in the WASH sector: WASH-Mali platform, intergenerational knowledge transfer, mentoring and training young people. In this way, the AJPEA will be revitalised and the project will contribute to growth and sustainability of the network</narrative>
  </description>
