    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">5.1- Total number of people reached with capacity building in wash business development, technical knowledge, life skills and partnerships for local businesses.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fill in total number of people currently reached with capacity building activities by the initiative, based upon documentation. Disaggregate Male/Female and disaggregate per type of event and provide nr of people per event.</narrative>
