     <actual value="843.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">06-11-2023: - 8 mini-sharing conferences were held and gathered 371 participants among which 101 women.   
- A group of 10 mentors is committed to contribute to the AJPEA and have mentored a total of 20 young professionals during the course of the programme:  12 mentors engaged in the mentor program  for 17 mentees young professionals during the last twelve months.
- Capacity building : 167 young were trained  on  leadership, IWA connection, digital communication , gender inclusiveness etc; including 87 women 
Total sum of capacity building numbers : 167 FROM TRAINEES + 371 FROM MIN CONF + 21 FROM AFTERWORK + 29 FROM MENTORING PROGRAM+ 200 from KICK OFF CEREMONY+ 55 FROM CLOSING CEREMONY= Total of 843 participants TO YWC EVENTS including 256 women 

Trainees and mentoring programme is counted as Business development / entrepreneurial training : 167+29 = 196
Learning &amp; knowledge sharing events: 371 from mini-conferences
Awareness raising &amp; lobbying : 200 + 55 opening and closing ceremony. 
Stakeholder events: 21</narrative>
